---
title: "rls_policy_admin_tables (0000_create_member_schema)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_role: evaluate request role
    q_check_role --> q_service_all_leaders: role = service_role (team_leaders)
    q_check_role --> q_service_all_gen: role = service_role (generation_roles)
    q_check_role --> q_deny: any other role

    q_service_all_leaders --> q_allow: USING(true) WITH CHECK(true) -- all operations on team_leaders
    q_service_all_gen --> q_allow: USING(true) WITH CHECK(true) -- all operations on generation_roles
    q_allow --> [*]: access granted
    q_deny --> [*]: access denied

    note right of q_check_role
        INV-001: team_leaders has NO policy for authenticated or anon roles
        INV-002: generation_roles has NO policy for authenticated or anon roles
        INV-003: Only service_role can read or modify these admin tables
        INV-004: Authenticated users cannot see who is a team leader via direct table query
    end note
